otlite (1.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New command: otlite results lists saved runs, filtered by tool, target,
    case, status and age, and sorted by time, tool, target, duration or size.

 -- Sushant Koul <sushant@osintverse.com>  Thu, 22 Oct 2026 15:30:00 +0530

otlite (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Renamed from otinstaller to otlite, the no-Docker edition of OTInstaller.
    Replaces the otinstaller package; the OTINSTALLER_* variables are still
    read and the first run copies settings from ~/.otinstaller.
  * The end-of-life notice is gone: otlite is supported.

 -- Sushant Koul <sushant@osintverse.com>  Thu, 22 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0530

